WEBVTT

00:30:30.038 --> 00:30:35.121
that person should still be rewarded
and be given a good future in

00:30:35.121 --> 00:30:36.121
the company.

00:30:36.371 --> 00:30:38.538
That's a third step for de-escalation,

00:30:38.954 --> 00:30:41.371
taking the stigma out of
admitting a failure.

00:30:42.371 --> 00:30:46.079
It's created an annual ceremony
to recognize people who have

00:30:46.079 --> 00:30:47.788
the wisdom to pull the plug,

00:30:48.579 --> 00:30:51.329
because even if it wasn't the breakthrough
they'd hoped for,

00:30:51.704 --> 00:30:54.204
their time and resources
were still well spent.

00:30:54.579 --> 00:30:59.704
That day is all about celebrating the
project that are no longer with us

00:30:59.704 --> 00:31:05.163
and recognizing them for everything
that they gave X,